{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">文化體育及旅遊局局長羅淑佩，在四川成都出席一個以香港玩具為主題的展覽。<br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">展覽主題是「香港玩具文化與IP展」，由香港品牌玩具協會主辦、文體旅局轄下文創產業發展處資助，響應政府在成都舉辦的「香港周」活動。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.LAW-1630.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026A80uiiWAnV1788602445.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.LAW-1630.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">展覽由27組香港設計師或品牌，以玩具文化與IP創新為主題，展出逾40件香港品牌及原創藝術玩具，包括由七名香港玩具設計師，加入太極拳、詠春等元素，創作的玩具。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.LAW-1630_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026HIV4xyyWn21788602414.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.LAW-1630_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.LAW-1630_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026pUPHF4aJAi1788602469.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.LAW-1630_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T10:19:28.965049+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}